    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whisker Squadron:Untitled Space Game is the second game in the Whisker Squadron universe, and will land on Steam in 2025 (with a real name!). You can read about it below. In the meantime, check out Whisker Squadron: Survivor - a more streamlined corridor shooter with roguelite survival elements, featuring the same cast of feline pilots by visiting our Developer page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Engage in epic space combat with your feline pilot of choice! You'll explore free-roaming space zones filled with opportunity and peril</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303400/extras/ef174494f6ca38a30749f154a5a9bc48.poster.avif?t=1739649473\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303400/extras/ef174494f6ca38a30749f154a5a9bc48.webm?t=1739649473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303400/extras/ef174494f6ca38a30749f154a5a9bc48.mp4?t=1739649473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><i>Take on epic bosses at the end of each of 3 acts</i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303400/extras/e785e9767fd3ee7d58a7c8ae0d63e238.poster.avif?t=1739649473\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303400/extras/e785e9767fd3ee7d58a7c8ae0d63e238.webm?t=1739649473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303400/extras/e785e9767fd3ee7d58a7c8ae0d63e238.mp4?t=1739649473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Outfit your high tech ship with your feline pilot of choice, and choose your path through an ever-changing galaxy that's uniquely generated for each 60-minute run. Explore space for loot and opportunities, upgrade your equipment along the way, and try to survive the depths of space while fending off the Swarm. Orbit tiny moons and clear them of bosses, preserve your fuel, and try to make it to the end of the map in one piece.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features<i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Procedurally generated, rogue-like mission structure that's unique every time you play<br> Experience free-roaming space-based &quot;exploration zones&quot;<br> Choose your pilots from a cast of 5 feline heroes<br> Dozens of unique weapons, ship augmentations, and items to unlock</p>",
